{
  "an4.54:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 4.54 ",
  "an4.54:0.2": "6. Overflowing Merit ",
  "an4.54:0.3": "Living Together (2nd) ",
  "an4.54:1.1": "“Mendicants, there are four ways of living together. ",
  "an4.54:1.2": "What four? ",
  "an4.54:1.3": "A male zombie living with a female zombie; ",
  "an4.54:1.4": "a male zombie living with a goddess; ",
  "an4.54:1.5": "a god living with a female zombie; ",
  "an4.54:1.6": "a god living with a goddess. ",
  "an4.54:2.1": "And how does a male zombie live with a female zombie? ",
  "an4.54:2.2": "It’s when the husband kills living creatures, steals, commits sexual misconduct; he uses speech that’s false, backbiting, harsh, or nonsensical; and he’s covetous, malicious, and has wrong view. He’s unethical, of bad character, living at home with his heart full of the stain of stinginess, abusing and insulting ascetics and brahmins. ",
  "an4.54:2.3": "And the wife is also … unethical, of bad character … ",
  "an4.54:2.4": "That’s how a male zombie lives with a female zombie. ",
  "an4.54:3.1": "And how does a male zombie live with a goddess? ",
  "an4.54:3.2": "It’s when the husband … is unethical, of bad character … ",
  "an4.54:3.3": "But the wife doesn’t kill living creatures, steal, or commit sexual misconduct. She doesn’t use speech that’s false, divisive, harsh, or nonsensical. And she’s contented, kind-hearted, with right view. She’s ethical, of good character, living at home with heart rid of the stain of stinginess, not abusing a